WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:00.270
<b>Deathpiea</b>

3
00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:10.360
Rubber. It doesn't conduct electricity!

4
00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:15.020
And so that means, Eneru can't
hurt a rubber person!

5
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:22.030
Go Luffy! Stop him.

6
00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.880
You! You're no mere mortal!
What are you?

7
00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:44.050
Me? I'm Luffy.
A pirate, and a rubber man.

8
00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:46.440
What? Rubber?

9
00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.100
I see. Rubber doesn't exist in Skypiea.

10
00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.730
He doesn't know what it is.

11
00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.780
That lightning of yours...
won't work on me!

12
00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:55.740
Mantra.

13
00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.710
Gum-Gum... Whip!

14
00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.190
Luffy!

15
00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:35.780
Don't push your luck.

16
00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.910
Lightning can cause far more
than just electric shocks.

17
00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.990
But I don't have to tell
you that, "rubber man."

18
00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.660
You found out the hard way!

19
00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:50.370
You're gonna
have to do better than that!

20
00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.920
I see!

21
00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.840
He's got that weird ability
to predict my moves. Dammit!

22
00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.890
Just what is this "rubber"?

23
00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:06.940
Now, hold on. This "rubber man".

24
00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:11.030
He's a paramecia.
Even they have weaknesses.

25
00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.240
Gloam... Paddling!

26
00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.080
Huh?

27
00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:21.870
I'm on a bit of a schedule,
so I don't have time to play.

28
00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.710
He! He's changing
his staff into a blade!

29
00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.170
Think of it as lightning in solid form!

30
00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.930
As I thought, slashing
attacks are your weakness!

31
00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:41.810
Yeah.

32
00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.340
Don't tell him that!

33
00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.880
Gum-Gum Gatling!

34
00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:51.880
Where'd he go?

35
00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.650
Luffy! Behind you!

36
00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.740
He can move right through... the gold?

37
00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.770
You may be
immune to lightning,

38
00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.860
but not to electric heat it seems!

39
00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.330
Gum-Gum...!

40
00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:39.110
...Battle Axe!

41
00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.340
You blasphemous brat!

42
00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:57.050
All right! Gum-Gum... Gatling!

43
00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:09.310
It's not as though
you grew more arms, Idiot!

44
00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.520
Luffy!

45
00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.650
Sightseeing on sky island. Hmph.

46
00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:22.370
You Blue Sea people certainly
picked a bad time to visit.

47
00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:28.400
I am this land's god. I can
do anything my will desires.

48
00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.330
I've long dreamed of
creating an ideal world!

49
00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:37.040
This dream will become a reality,
and I won't let anyone stand in my way!

50
00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:41.880
Least of all some whelp
from the Blue Sea world!

51
00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.840
Now, where were we?
Ah, yes. How could I forget?

52
00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.430
We were going to watch this land die.

53
00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.060
No! You can't!

54
00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:59.190
Max. Two hundred million volt Vari!

55
00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:17.200
Horsey-Bird! What are we gonna do?

56
00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.080
It's moving!

57
00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:27.760
Luffy! Nami!

58
00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:33.460
Behold! Maxim!

59
00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.130
The ark that will take
me to Endless Vearth!

60
00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:42.900
To the sacred land without end
that I desire! Rise Maxim! Rise!

61
00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.740
It's... flying!

62
00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.190
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!

63
00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.860
This is bad!

64
00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:04.490
Luffy! Hurry up and stop Eneru!

65
00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:06.820
But, wait a minute!
This ark's powered by Eneru,

66
00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:09.200
so if he's defeated,
it'll crash with us on it!

67
00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.740
But if he's not, the sky islands
going to be destroyed!

68
00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:15.540
And if we stay here and do nothing, we'll
be taken to some land far away with Eneru!

69
00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.790
Oh, I don't like our options!

70
00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.880
No matter what happens, we still lose!

71
00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.760
What are we gonna do, Luffy?

72
00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.510
I'm really scared!

73
00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:34.770
Huh?

74
00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:37.380
Don't be. Just calm down.

75
00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:40.300
Calm down? But how?

76
00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:44.840
You sail with the crew of the
future King of the Pirates.

77
00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:48.430
So wipe that frown off, all right?

78
00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:57.940
King of the Pirates? And what
domain does he lord over?

79
00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:06.410
He's the king of the seas!
The greatest king of all!

80
00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.790
Hpmh! So you say.

81
00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:15.250
But we'll soon learn if
that's true. Won't we?

82
00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:46.090
Here, look! The ship! It's stopped!

83
00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:48.710
It's stuck in the Vearth!
It can't go any higher!

84
00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:50.880
But look! It's scraping away!

85
00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.340
It's only a matter of time
before it breaks through!

86
00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.680
No, we can't. We'll get in his way!

87
00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.930
He may be from the Blue Sea world,
but Luffy's still a warrior!

88
00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.850
A warrior's duel is sacred!

89
00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.810
You should never interfere in it!

90
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.380
The circuit to
this ark's ultimate function

91
00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:14.140
has been initiated and is now
running at full capacity!

92
00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:17.560
It has a name. It's called Deathpiea.

93
00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.270
The despair that will
destroy this world.

94
00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:50.740
Chief! Come quick!

95
00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.880
Something's happening in
the sky over Upperyard!

96
00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.660
What is it?

97
00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.290
It. It just suddenly got dark!

98
00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:01.960
I've never seen the skies over
this island look like that.

99
00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.420
Strange. What could it be?

100
00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.840
Do you think something bad
happened to Wyper and the warriors?

101
00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:14.140
I hope not, but I, too, have never
seen such dark clouds in the sky of the

102
00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.350
White-White Sea.

103
00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:21.750
Using my energy, Deathpiea
forces extremely turbulent air

104
00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.710
currents together, which produce
those lovely thunderclouds

105
00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:26.830
you see billowing out right now.

106
00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.380
Thunderclouds?

107
00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.630
Soon they will envelop
all of Skypiea in darkness.

108
00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:36.550
Inside them, energy will continue to build
until it's reached its absolute peak.

109
00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:40.010
And then, on my signal,
they will unleash thunderbolts

110
00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:44.640
of such magnitude that every trace
of this land will be obliterated!

111
00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:48.020
Allow me to demonstrate.

112
00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:03.540
That came from Upperyard!
Get to the ships!

113
00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.330
Everyone, keep calm! Don't panic!

114
00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.710
Get on a ship and head for Cloud End!

115
00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.770
Damn you!

116
00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.490
Eneru!

117
00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.610
You... just...

118
00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.380
I just teased the angels a little.

119
00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.100
But after all, that is my right.

120
00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:43.560
So being a god makes it
okay to destroy everything?

121
00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:47.440
Of course. Everything here
is mine for the taking.

122
00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.360
Their land. Their lives.

123
00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.360
Speaking of which...

124
00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.910
I'll continue celebrating
by taking yours!

125
00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:03.590
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Hot! Hot!

126
00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:07.800
This spear has
been highly charged!

127
00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.110
Dammit!

128
00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:32.950
How. How can I defeat a guy,
who can predict my moves?

129
00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.790
Yeah!

130
00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:40.010
Gum-Gum...

131
00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:40.970
...Daze...

132
00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.220
What are you doing? Hey!

133
00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:59.750
He's dodging the attacks unconsciously
and just relying on his reflexes!

134
00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.940
It's almost like he's a
blade of grass that sways

135
00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.360
back and forth in the wind
instead of opposing it!

136
00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.420
He's not thinking! That's why
Eneru can't predict his moves!

137
00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.580
Huh?

138
00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:20.620
But if I switch my brain off...
Then I can't attack him!

139
00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.000
Don't stop now!

140
00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.500
I gotta get my hands on
him somehow. Come on! Think!

141
00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.600
There's gotta be a way.

142
00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.020
That's it!

143
00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.350
Gum-Gum... Octopus!

144
00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:39.800
Enough with the stupid ideas!

145
00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:44.390
I take it you're no
fan of my Mantra, are you?

146
00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:48.930
That's to be expected, since it
is the basis of my power!

147
00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:51.980
That place should work!

148
00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.460
Gum-Gum...

149
00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.290
It doesn't matter what you try.

150
00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:46.540
Of course!
The punches are ricocheting.

151
00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.580
He's not consciously controlling them!

152
00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.430
I'm not letting you get away again!

153
00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:55.340
Gum-Gum...

154
00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.590
No!

155
00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:59.220
...Bazooka!

156
00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:21.280
No! He's charging!
I... I have to escape!

157
00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:25.010
Gum-Gum...

158
00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.700
He can't!

159
00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.500
I... I'm a god!

160
00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.960
...Rifle!

161
00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:06.910
Oh, no! The ships leaving the Vearth!

162
00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:13.420
What are we gonna do?
It's gonna fly away!

163
00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.380
It worked! You did it!

164
00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.620
But... wait!

165
00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.120
The ship's taking off!

166
00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:27.150
Oh, no way. He's getting back up!

167
00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:31.240
You fools! Is that the best you can do?

168
00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.620
Make no mistake, boy!

169
00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.420
When you're gone,
the world will be mine!

170
00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:51.300
And once again, everyone will fear
me, worship me, and revere me!

171
00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:54.220
I am all-powerful!

172
00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:59.460
In this world, filth like you
must learn the only truth.

173
00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:05.130
By my hand, nothing is ever impossible!

174
00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:12.740
For I am the Almighty God!

175
00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.070
Hey, look!

176
00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.390
Up in the sky, something
floating over Upper Yard!

177
00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.160
It's a... ship!

178
00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.190
A flying ship? Impossible!

179
00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:27.110
I've never heard of such a thing!

180
00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:36.220
That's what made the sky turn dark?

181
00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.850
God is on that ship!

182
00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:44.740
Hey! You gotta get outta here!

183
00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:47.030
Board the ships!

184
00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:54.530
Vessels are leaving Angel
Island by the hundreds!

185
00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:01.680
What evil is this? Those dark
clouds are an ominous sign.

186
00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.000
Look! Someone is coming this way!

187
00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.340
Shandorians!

188
00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:10.760
Take heed! Ready your
ships and evacuate!

189
00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:13.510
The sky islands are doomed!

190
00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.560
They're what?!

191
00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.180
You have to escape!

192
00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.340
To the Sea!

193
00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.010
Not... the Blue Sea?

194
00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:39.510
Look hard, rubber boy.

195
00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:42.350
On a falling island's despair.

196
00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:52.440
Skypeia will be destroyed,
the angels' lives extinguished.

197
00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.920
No one can stop me. Heh.

198
00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.850
Not even you!

199
00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.950
Wanna bet?

200
00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:01.870
Gloam...!

201
00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.010
The golden wall!

202
00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.180
No you don't!

203
00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.520
...Paddling!

204
00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:07.770
Ah! Hot! Hot! Hot!

205
00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.360
He melted it like butter!

206
00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:15.990
Yowtch! It burns! It burns! It burns!

207
00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.610
Luffy!

208
00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:21.320
It won't come off!

209
00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:23.490
What's the matter, rubber man?

210
00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.120
Don't you like the way
I've evened the odds?

211
00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.070
I've simply taken the fight out of you.

212
00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.910
Get this off of me!

213
00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:36.050
You see, I'm honestly not sure I
could take another hit from you.

214
00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:43.110
Therefore... I think it
best if we sever ties.

215
00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:46.440
But in honor of the spirited
effort you've put forth,

216
00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:49.700
take this gold bauble
as a parting gift!

217
00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:10.710
Luffy!

218
00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:16.440
Once I'm finally rid of you,
this world will be mine again!

219
00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:20.820
Just as it was before.

220
00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:24.530
And not a soul in the
world can defeat me!

221
00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.390
Not a soul in the world?

222
00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.450
Hmph.

223
00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:33.050
You're an idiot! Even if
I can't defeat you,

224
00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:38.340
back in the Blue Sea, there are tons more
fighters who can put you in your place!

225
00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:40.510
Someone like you could never...

226
00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:44.560
You talk too much, boy.

227
00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:49.650
Now fall!
Fall along with the sky island!

228
00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.230
You won't win!

229
00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.880
No!

230
00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.550
No!

231
00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.180
Luffy...

232
00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:07.520
Eneru!

233
00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:13.360
Horsey-Bird, look!
That's Luffy! He's falling!

234
00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.570
Oh no. Aisa and Pierre!

235
00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.410
– Aisa.

236
00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:25.410
So that sly, little voice I've
been hearing has a name.

237
00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:29.790
Fight me, you coward!

238
00:22:31.540 --> 00:22:33.620
Luffy! We're coming to save you!

239
00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:38.720
I tire of this. Time to die!

240
00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:42.220
Aisa! Pierre! He's gonna shoot you!

241
00:22:42.220 --> 00:22:44.970
Eneru!

242
00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:49.270
God's Judgment!

243
00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:51.850
El... Thor!

244
00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:06.240
Luffy!

245
00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:11.620
Aisa! Pierre!

246
00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:15.150
For all my strength, he hurt me.

247
00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:20.150
Yet, here I stand, the victor.

248
00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.450
It's enormous.

249
00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:35.890
So, this is the ark the Divine
Squad was forced to build.

250
00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:43.320
Right here. On the
northeastern edge of the island.

251
00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:48.260
After the others get the gold, this is
where we're all supposed to meet up.

252
00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:52.330
And once all of you are together again,
you're planning to escape, right?

253
00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:54.160
As long as we have the treasure!

254
00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:57.410
I'm not going anywhere without it! Heh!

255
00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.270
Nami.

256
00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:04.650
They're heading northeast toward the seashore.
No doubt returning to their ship.

257
00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:08.820
The smartest thing right now is go on
ahead and wait for them to show up.

258
00:24:08.820 --> 00:24:12.240
Afterall, they'll need me to
guide them back to the Blue Sea!

259
00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.790
I'm their best chance
to escape the island!

260
00:24:17.480 --> 00:24:19.940
But I have to get to
the Going Merry, and fast!

261
00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:24.200
Nami.

262
00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:27.410
You smell nice.

263
00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:31.000
No! It's not fair!

264
00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:34.250
One minute I'm dreaming,
the next I'm in a nightmare!

265
00:24:34.250 --> 00:24:36.040
Wait. Hold on.

266
00:24:36.250 --> 00:24:37.210
Nami?

267
00:24:41.290 --> 00:24:44.380
What... What is that?

268
00:24:50.970 --> 00:24:52.510
Nami!

269
00:24:53.210 --> 00:24:55.050
She's in trouble!

270
00:24:58.170 --> 00:25:00.260
Hey, Usopp! Wake up!

271
00:25:00.260 --> 00:25:03.600
This is no time to be
in bed, you idiot!

272
00:25:03.600 --> 00:25:07.860
What is it? What's wrong?

273
00:25:07.860 --> 00:25:09.950
Never mind that. Let's go!

274
00:25:09.950 --> 00:25:12.510
Huh? Go where?

275
00:25:12.570 --> 00:25:14.160
Where d'you think? To rescue Nami.

276
00:25:15.060 --> 00:25:18.230
Rescue, huh? Um...

277
00:25:18.590 --> 00:25:20.790
Oh yeah, it's all
comin' back to me!

278
00:25:20.790 --> 00:25:22.710
I-I remember everything!

279
00:25:34.500 --> 00:25:37.290
No. God came!

280
00:25:37.290 --> 00:25:38.960
– Oh, nice, I angered a God!
– Would you relax?

281
00:25:38.960 --> 00:25:40.590
He's long gone by now.

282
00:25:40.590 --> 00:25:42.350
...how can I get myself smotted?

283
00:25:42.350 --> 00:25:43.640
It's Nami who's in trouble!

284
00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:45.980
She's the one who got kidnapped!

285
00:25:45.980 --> 00:25:47.290
Nami?

286
00:25:47.290 --> 00:25:49.960
How could we have been so stupid?

287
00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:54.010
This is all our fault!
She's too cute for this!

288
00:25:54.010 --> 00:25:59.150
Okay, so he took her... But where to?

289
00:26:01.920 --> 00:26:02.830
There!

290
00:26:03.100 --> 00:26:04.100
Huh?

291
00:26:06.560 --> 00:26:10.470
It's big! Big ship! Flying!

292
00:26:10.470 --> 00:26:16.050
Though I only saw her for a second,
I'm sure it was Nami on that ship.

293
00:26:16.050 --> 00:26:20.250
And while I may not know
what dangers lie ahead,

294
00:26:20.250 --> 00:26:22.500
at least she's not wearing
that t-shirt anymore!

295
00:26:22.500 --> 00:26:25.750
Again with the t-shirt? Focus!

296
00:26:25.750 --> 00:26:28.170
I feel like I'm missing something here.

297
00:26:28.170 --> 00:26:31.540
Where're Conis, Weird Knight
and the others?

298
00:26:31.540 --> 00:26:34.790
I don't know. But we have to hurry.

299
00:26:43.650 --> 00:26:46.020
Hey, Sanji! Where ya going?

300
00:26:46.020 --> 00:26:48.100
To that ship! Where else?

301
00:26:48.100 --> 00:26:49.890
Say what?!

302
00:26:49.890 --> 00:26:53.830
Run faster or we'll lose'em!
My love needs us!

303
00:26:53.830 --> 00:26:57.730
Yeah, so um, if I'm following you,
does that mean I'm going too?

304
00:26:57.730 --> 00:27:00.020
Of course! I need
your help to get on board!

305
00:27:00.020 --> 00:27:01.900
You still have that rope you
shoot outta your belly?

306
00:27:01.900 --> 00:27:04.690
My "Usopp Ahh-ahh-ahh"? Oh sure!

307
00:27:04.690 --> 00:27:06.570
I'll let you use it
while I wait down here!

308
00:27:06.570 --> 00:27:08.320
Just hurry up, ya coward!

309
00:27:08.320 --> 00:27:10.730
No, wait! You don't need me!

310
00:27:10.730 --> 00:27:12.360
The air's too thin up there!

311
00:27:12.360 --> 00:27:16.320
I'm coming for you,
Nami, my beautiful swan!

312
00:27:20.690 --> 00:27:23.450
Now that the Ark Maxim is activated,

313
00:27:25.490 --> 00:27:29.450
nothing can save this nation
from its inevitable destruction.

314
00:27:30.760 --> 00:27:34.470
What's wrong? You're lucky
to have made it this far.

315
00:27:34.470 --> 00:27:36.930
Abandon all thoughts of your
incompetent playmates

316
00:27:36.930 --> 00:27:41.100
and embrace the glorious
future I've given you.

317
00:27:41.100 --> 00:27:44.160
Yeah, thanks. You're a swell guy.

318
00:27:44.160 --> 00:27:46.910
But one thing's more
precious than gold.

319
00:27:49.190 --> 00:27:51.990
It's a treasure called friendship.

320
00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:57.580
We're gonna to get some gold!

321
00:27:59.750 --> 00:28:00.830
I treasure!

322
00:28:00.830 --> 00:28:02.830
Tomorrow!

323
00:28:07.090 --> 00:28:12.550
What good is owning the world's
wealth without friends to share it?

324
00:28:12.550 --> 00:28:14.340
This island is filled with riches

325
00:28:14.340 --> 00:28:18.070
I'd love to get my hands on.
But sacrificing my friends

326
00:28:18.070 --> 00:28:21.400
and enduring your ego
is too steep a price to pay.

327
00:28:21.400 --> 00:28:23.150
So, your treasure?

328
00:28:24.430 --> 00:28:29.100
It's yours. I don't want it!

329
00:28:29.100 --> 00:28:32.350
Really? You don't want anything?

330
00:28:39.070 --> 00:28:41.910
Not even... your life?

331
00:28:44.490 --> 00:28:47.360
Calm down, Suu. Tell me what happened?

332
00:28:51.120 --> 00:28:54.080
But, wait! Neither Sanji
nor Usopp are in any shape

333
00:28:54.080 --> 00:28:56.920
to be moving around!
Why aren't they here?

334
00:28:59.050 --> 00:29:01.510
Where did they go?

335
00:29:01.510 --> 00:29:03.340
Come on, tell me!

336
00:29:03.300 --> 00:29:04.470
<b>Um...</b>

337
00:29:04.470 --> 00:29:05.600
<b>Oh, right!</b>

338
00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:08.310
<b>The guy with the cool eyebrows
woke up first... woke up first...</b>

339
00:29:08.850 --> 00:29:10.810
<b>and he woke up the liar
with the long nose. with the long nose.</b>

340
00:29:09.910 --> 00:29:12.100
Sanji woke up and
then he woke up Usopp.

341
00:29:10.810 --> 00:29:12.860
<b>They ran as fast as they could...</b>

342
00:29:12.100 --> 00:29:16.270
And they both ran and jumped up?

343
00:29:13.110 --> 00:29:14.110
<b>used a weird gadget...</b>

344
00:29:14.110 --> 00:29:15.570
<b>and went to that flying ship.</b>

345
00:29:16.270 --> 00:29:19.400
To the... the ship? You're sure?

346
00:29:22.030 --> 00:29:23.880
But they're not fully healed!

347
00:29:23.880 --> 00:29:27.190
Oh, look at this place. It's a mess.

348
00:29:47.620 --> 00:29:54.000
Usopp Aa-aa-ahh!
Usopp Aa-aa-ahh! Come on!

349
00:29:56.170 --> 00:30:01.840
God of the White Sea or not,
if he lays a finger on Nami,

350
00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:05.430
I'll be his personal
Blue Sea nightmare!

351
00:30:06.910 --> 00:30:10.000
Nami swan!

352
00:30:17.020 --> 00:30:21.360
Luffy. I need to borrow
some of your courage!

353
00:30:25.070 --> 00:30:30.590
When you're lost and alone, call out and lead me to your side

354
00:30:30.810 --> 00:30:36.010
As you wander far from home, you search the sky and never hide

355
00:30:36.010 --> 00:30:38.810
You are so much like the moon

356
00:30:38.810 --> 00:30:43.460
Calmer than a star, your twinkling's lost

357
00:30:46.910 --> 00:30:55.860
A deep reflection shines, you slowly leave, fading, and what's the cost?

358
00:30:55.920 --> 00:31:01.090
Stay as you are, don't lose your way

359
00:31:01.090 --> 00:31:09.400
Let my words guide you, and look ahead until the day!

360
00:31:10.040 --> 00:31:16.290
Don't give up on your dreams, through endless nights they come to you

361
00:31:16.290 --> 00:31:21.910
If you stop, you'll never see them shining through!

362
00:31:23.150 --> 00:31:27.680
Will you return? Maybe not... Will you learn? I hope you do

363
00:31:27.680 --> 00:31:34.070
Please put your past to rest, and live your life anew.
